Map data (Data/Tiles.lua, Data/Overlays.lua)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Generated by tools/terrain.py and tools/overlays.py from the game client's own tables and map files,
read through wago.tools at a pinned client build. They are lists of file IDs and positions of the
game's own textures, which the game loads; no game art is shipped.

The choice of which maps to include follows TerrainWorldMap by Dramacydal
